WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.079
Should a phone need its owner's ID to
work?

00:00:07.029 --> 00:00:12.507
Mexico now ties every phone line to its
owner's ID, against extortion and fraud.

00:00:13.457 --> 00:00:18.936
Unlinked lines are cut off by last digit.
Ending in 3: 2.2 million lines.

00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:25.364
Calls, texts, data: off. The number is
kept until the line is linked.

00:00:26.214 --> 00:00:31.943
No ID, no phone. The earthquake alert
still gets through.
